text Tomoyo looks behind her. Of course, there's nothing there.
text But it must have just been that she was so caught up in what she was saying that she didn't realize what I meant.
text So without replying, I do what I wanted to do.
text I move around her and cling tightly to her back.
text As if relieved, Tomoyo takes a deep breath.
sound 76H.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text They couldn't be happy unless they betrayed each other.
sound 76I.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text But that kind of thing won't give you happiness at all.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah... I agree.
sound 76J.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text The entire time... I was emotionally unstable.
sound 76K.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I felt like I could never forgive them for any of it. But then a few seconds later, I'd feel like I COULD forgive them for the exact same things.
sound 76L.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Then a couple more seconds later, all of it would just turn into an object of hatred for me.
sound 76M.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That was the cycle I'd go through.
sound 76N.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I'm sure everyone goes through something like this at some point in their lives.
text @[Tomoya]
text But everyone manages to get through that.
sound 76O.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That's right. By being supported by someone.
sound 76P.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I didn't have anyone like that.
sound 76Q.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That's why I went wild.
sound 76R.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Of course, I admit that I was more fragile than other people.
sound 76S.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Since all I could ever do was blame other people for everything.
sound 76T.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text But after that, I found someone to support me.
sound 76U.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text And so a lot of things became clear to me.
text @[Tomoya]
text If that person was a man, I'm probably going to go mad with jealousy.
sound 76V.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It was a man.
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you serious...?
sound 76W.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Mhm. It was my little brother.
text @[Tomoya]
text I never knew. So you had a little brother...
sound 76X.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I do. He was raised just the way I was back then.
sound 76Y.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text To be honest, I was actually quite bitter toward that very brother.
sound 76Z.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text While everything was turning into an object for my hatred, even my own brother wasn't immune...
text @[Tomoya]
text Right...
sound 770.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text My little brother was always afraid...
sound 771.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text And when I think back, all I can ever remember of him is that pained look on his face.
sound 772.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I never knew he could even smile...
sound 773.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I truly wasn't a good sister at all...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's not your fault.
sound 774.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I'll take those as words of consolation.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm so useless as a boyfriend.
sound 775.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text This runs really deep for me. Please cut me at least a little slack on this.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay... Please continue.
sound 776.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I'm pretty sure my brother didn't run wild because I beat him to it.
sound 777.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I ran away before he could.
sound 778.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I abandoned my little brother.
sound 779.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I left him all alone in that family...
sound 77A.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...and he tried holding on to that family.
sound 77B.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text He tried to cling to it because it was his true family. Even though it had stopped being an actual family.
sound 77C.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Do you know how irrational and meaningless that is?
text @[Tomoya]
text I do...
sound 77D.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Then spring, two years ago.
sound 77E.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text My parents eventually, or rather, finally... tried to divorce.
sound 77F.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text In a way, they fed on each other's misery, so I never thought it would happen.
sound 77G.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text But I guess, in the end, that's still how things ended up.
sound 77H.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It's nothing strange. Since both of them were already with other people at this point...
sound 77I.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Our family wasn't going to be a family anymore. It never really had been in the first place, but even so, it was still ours...
sound 77J.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text And now that family was really going to fall apart.
sound 77K.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text My little brother was afraid of that.
sound 77L.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text And so, he went to his last resort.
sound 77M.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text A last resort... that you can probably use only once...
sound 77N.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Can you imagine what he did...?
text @[Tomoya]
text No...
