	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
music BGM01.mp3
sound 78I.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text For me, he was the best little brother I could ask for.
sound 78J.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I can be proud of him from the bottom of my heart.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah.
sound 78K.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I actually take a little pride in him these days.
sound 78L.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Well, I wouldn't normally talk about this with other people, though.
sound 78M.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Ever since that day, I decided to do my best and hold onto my family, together with my little brother.
sound 78N.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I studied a great deal.
sound 78O.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text After one year, I was even able to enter a school of this caliber.
sound 78P.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text And when I did, my parents had smiles on their faces.
sound 78Q.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It really knocked my socks off, you might say.
sound 78R.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It's fun now, too, working hard to see their faces like that.
text @[Tomoya]
text That so? I guess things are fine now, then.
sound 78S.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Yeah, you don't need to worry.
text @[Tomoya]
text In the midst of your talk, I was thinking of eloping with you or something.
sound 78T.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Are you serious? That's a pretty startling statement, if so.
text @[Tomoya]
text I was half-joking, but I was also half-serious.
sound 78U.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text In that case, I'm half-annoyed, and half-happy.
sound 78V.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text But there's no hate in my family right now, so we won't be doing that.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's a pity.
text @[Tomoya]
text So in other words...
text I then let go of Tomoyo.
text @[Tomoya]
text You want to become student council president to surprise your parents?
sound 78W.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It's not a simple reason like that.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then what is it?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM22S"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM22S.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 78X.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Did you know? There used to be a row of sakura trees right beyond this point.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm?
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I don't know how that's related to what we're talking about, but I shift my attention over that way.
text I was able to see a tract of brown land far away.
text The words "Housing Development" come to mind.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, yeah, I remember now...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM22S"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM22S.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 78Y.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text The town is changing. That's natural, though.
sound 78Z.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It was that place from my memories.
sound 790.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Just beyond that is the little hospital I mentioned.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah... I see.
text I understood.
text @[Tomoya]
text This is the road you walked on with your little brother, isn't it?
sound 791.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That's right.
sound 792.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I had wanted to walk through here one more time.
sound 793.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Standing side by side with my little brother, in the midst of the falling cherry blossoms.
sound 794.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text And I wanted to have the conversation I couldn't have back then because I was crying.
sound 795.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I wanted to tell him, "Yeah, they're beautiful."
sound 796.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That was all I wanted...
sound 797.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text The town will change. There's nothing we can do about that.
sound 798.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text But if it's possible to fight it, I want to fight it with everything I have.
sound 799.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text To save all the pleasant memories I have here, to make sure they can be left in peace.
sound 79A.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That's why I want to save the row of sakura lining the hill-road to school with my own two hands.
text @[Tomoya]
text So that's how it was...
sound 79B.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text To save that row of sakura trees. That will be my presidential promise.
sound 79C.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text And remember, this isn't something I want to do just for myself.
sound 79D.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It's also for the students who come to our school, and all the students who will enroll in the future. It's for everyone.
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s15
fi
goto 19
label s15
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 19
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
jump SEEN2506_0_0.scr
